ss-of-bug | name split on the changed line; `readWords:133-147` merges the quoted value | `doctor-setup.yaml:61`, `doctor-symlink-check.yaml:60` |\n\n## Remediation Workstreams\n\n### P0\n\nNone.\n\n### P1\n\n=== state\n1 correctness complete {'P0': 0, 'P1': 1, 'P2': 1} ['`make no changes to` reads a genuine no-edit request as a change request', 'The guard matches a literal single space, so line-break and punctuation variants keep the pass-three defect']\n2 correctness complete {'P0': 0, 'P1': 0, 'P2': 1} ['A long flag whose value is attached by shell quoting still reports ok for a command node refuses to run']\n3 security-traceability-maintainability complete {'P0': 0, 'P1': 0, 'P2': 0} []\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b && cat review-report.md | head -120; echo \\\"=== state\\\"; cat deep-review-state.jsonl | python3 -c \\\"\\nimport sys,json\\nfor line in sys.stdin:\\n    try: d=json.loads(line)\\n    except: continue\\n    if d.get('type')=='iteration':\\n        print(d['iteration'], d.get('focus'), d.get('status'), d.get('findingsSummary'), [f.get('title') for f in d.get('findingDetails',[])])\\n\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794596992151,"end":1794596993492}}}}
