{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794597259121,"sessionID":"ses_e29b1d959ffeIRu3GDOv5mxZKO","part":{"partID":"prt_1d655040b001pyiHWNzt1dJPUL","sessionID":"ses_e29b1d959ffeIRu3GDOv5mxZKO","messageID":"msg_1d65490a2001EhXe7WLQ4AJ4Sm","type":"tool","id":"call_632c5b0dbb6f48e3adb7ac49","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git log --oneline -8 -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts; echo ===; git log -S \"isNoEditRequest(promptLower)\" --oneline -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts | head"},"output":"11f3a30814 fix(system-skill-advisor): close the review pass two findings\nb3b5ae8314 fix(system-skill-advisor): close review pass one across the command surfacing code\n7af52ef940 feat(system-skill-advisor): offer the fitting command on more plain requests\n70fccfe9de feat(system-skill-advisor): deliver a typed command with its policy on every row\n3871b3d5bd feat(system-skill-advisor): put the command and policy in the brief and record offers\ncd4a834319 feat(system-skill-advisor): let a command pass on meaning, not only on its phrases\n35dc706743 feat(system-skill-advisor): attach hub commands and give each command its own row\n8a2aa8ab9f fix(system-skill-advisor): route read-only trigger-index questions to spec-kit\n===\n11f3a30814 fix(system-skill-advisor): close the review pass two findings\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"11f3a30814 fix(system-skill-advisor): close the review pass two findings\nb3b5ae8314 fix(system-skill-advisor): close review pass one across the command surfacing code\n7af52ef940 feat(system-skill-advisor): offer the fitting command on more plain requests\n70fccfe9de feat(system-skill-advisor): deliver a typed command with its policy on every row\n3871b3d5bd feat(system-skill-advisor): put the command and policy in the brief and record offers\ncd4a834319 feat(system-skill-advisor): let a command pass on meaning, not only on its phrases\n35dc706743 feat(system-skill-advisor): attach hub commands and give each command its own row\n8a2aa8ab9f fix(system-skill-advisor): route read-only trigger-index questions to spec-kit\n===\n11f3a30814 fix(system-skill-advisor): close the review pass two findings\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git log --oneline -8 -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts; echo ===; git log -S \\\"isNoEditRequest(promptLower)\\\" --oneline -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts | head\"}"},"time":{"start":1794597258251,"end":1794597259121}}}}
