{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794597411113,"sessionID":"ses_e29b1d959ffeIRu3GDOv5mxZKO","part":{"partID":"prt_1d65719ed001kiFQ3uGgsaaQUf","sessionID":"ses_e29b1d959ffeIRu3GDOv5mxZKO","messageID":"msg_1d657094e001xxIhkrdZF6ZNPF","type":"tool","id":"call_11548e66c9ea4f35a3b55f14","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - Command Surfacing Pass Three Closing Round (noedit-close-3c)\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nClosing review of the command-surfacing change, pass three. The lineage starts with the no-edit gate and goes deepest there, then reviews the doctor hook check once, then closes traceability and maintainability. Two settled decisions are out of scope: the \"make no changes\" phrase rules out a change whatever follows it, and the hook check is a wiring heuristic rather than a node or shell parser.\n\nTarget: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nInstruction source: `/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/c9fe91ef-9b85-4bdc-88fb-4d6f766eaecf/scratchpad/review-instructions-3c.txt`\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The two settled decisions: the \"make no changes\" scope-limit cost, and the hook heuristic's status as not-a-parser.\n- Code changes of any kind; this lineage writes only its own state files.\n- Holdout prompt text: never opened, never read.\n- The full suite, builds, daemons and model CLIs.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at 0.10 weighted new-finding ratio, or three iterations, whichever comes first.\n- A P0 finding stops the loop at synthesis and forces `Review verdict: FAIL`.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Empty at init]\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Empty at init]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: the no-edit gate (`NO_EDIT_REQUEST`, `isNoEditRequest`) and its three call sites, with the final-state reading of commit `846eab66b8`\n- Why: the dispatch orders this lineage to take the no-edit pattern first and deepest\n- Required evidence: a runnable probe that imports the shipped module and prints the matcher result plus the attached command for each prompt\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:287-298`, its callers `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:676-679` and `:877-885`, `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:147-165`, and `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`.\n- Hook pointers: `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs` (`readWords`, `simpleCommands`, `commandWords`, `nodeFlagSkipsScript`, `runsNodeOnMarker`, `scriptWord`, `runsMarker`) and `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs`.\n- Behavior claims: a prompt that rules out a change gets no command from either the hub-attach path or the scorer; the hook check reports `hook-missing` only for a command that does not launch node on the marker path.\n- Reuse and conventions: one shared matcher (`isNoEditRequest`) serves every gate, keeping them from drifting.\n- Review risks and gaps: the pattern is vocabulary, so missing or over-broad wording is the main reachable defect class; the hook check is a heuristic, so only a *valid* command it misreads is a defect there.\n- Prior context: pass two left 27 advisories and no blocker; the pass-three confirming round raised `make no changes to` (fixed by `846eab66b8`) and two advisories (separator width, quoted long-flag value) that the settled decisions close.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook surface in these two files |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-noedit-close-3c-1794596804847-827gze, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 13 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T19:16:02Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-close-3c/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-close-3c/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-close-3c/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - Command Surfacing Pass Three Closing Round (noedit-close-3c)\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nClosing review of the command-surfacing change, pass three. The lineage starts with the no-edit gate and goes deepest there, then reviews the doctor hook check once, then closes traceability and maintainability. Two settled decisions are out of scope: the \\\"make no changes\\\" phrase rules out a change whatever follows it, and the hook check is a wiring heuristic rather than a node or shell parser.\\n\\nTarget: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\\nInstruction source: `/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/c9fe91ef-9b85-4bdc-88fb-4d6f766eaecf/scratchpad/review-instructions-3c.txt`\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The two settled decisions: the \\\"make no changes\\\" scope-limit cost, and the hook heuristic's status as not-a-parser.\\n- Code changes of any kind; this lineage writes only its own state files.\\n- Holdout prompt text: never opened, never read.\\n- The full suite, builds, daemons and model CLIs.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence at 0.10 weighted new-finding ratio, or three iterations, whichever comes first.\\n- A P0 finding stops the loop at synthesis and forces `Review verdict: FAIL`.\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Empty at init]\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Empty at init]\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: the no-edit gate (`NO_EDIT_REQUEST`, `isNoEditRequest`) and its three call sites, with the final-state reading of commit `846eab66b8`\\n- Why: the dispatch orders this lineage to take the no-edit pattern first and deepest\\n- Required evidence: a runnable probe that imports the shipped module and prints the matcher result plus the attached command for each prompt\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:287-298`, its callers `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:676-679` and `:877-885`, `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:147-165`, and `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`.\\n- Hook pointers: `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs` (`readWords`, `simpleCommands`, `commandWords`, `nodeFlagSkipsScript`, `runsNodeOnMarker`, `scriptWord`, `runsMarker`) and `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs`.\\n- Behavior claims: a prompt that rules out a change gets no command from either the hub-attach path or the scorer; the hook check reports `hook-missing` only for a command that does not launch node on the marker path.\\n- Reuse and conventions: one shared matcher (`isNoEditRequest`) serves every gate, keeping them from drifting.\\n- Review risks and gaps: the pattern is vocabulary, so missing or over-broad wording is the main reachable defect class; the hook check is a heuristic, so only a *valid* command it misreads is a defect there.\\n- Prior context: pass two left 27 advisories and no blocker; the pass-three confirming round raised `make no changes to` (fixed by `846eab66b8`) and two advisories (separator width, quoted long-flag value) that the settled decisions close.\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook surface in these two files |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.v