e verb-list gap in `NO_EDIT_REQUEST`)\n+- **P2 (Minor):** 1 active (`NC3-P2-002`, the \"just show\"/\"just list\" false positive)\n+- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +1 P1, +1 P2\n \n [Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":3}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-close-3c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-close-3c/deep-review-strategy.md\",\"oldString\":\"- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\",\"newString\":\"- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 1 active (`NC3-P1-001`, the verb-list gap in `NO_EDIT_REQUEST`)\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 1 active (`NC3-P2-002`, the \\\"just show\\\"/\\\"just list\\\" false positive)\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +1 P1, +1 P2\"}"},"time":{"start":1794597638321,"end":1794597639870}}}}
