{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794597814031,"sessionID":"ses_e29b1d959ffeIRu3GDOv5mxZKO","part":{"partID":"prt_1d65d7bed001BQPkzw6rxhufOh","sessionID":"ses_e29b1d959ffeIRu3GDOv5mxZKO","messageID":"msg_1d65d5ea6001IIJQ4TtcgBZcZG","type":"tool","id":"call_e2265860028b43228a0a970d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b && tail -3 iterations/iteration-002.md; echo ===; tail -3 iterations/iteration-003.md"},"output":"- Recovery note: the `Review verdict` line stays CONDITIONAL while `NE3-P1-001` is active.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\n===\n- Required evidence: the findings registry totals, the three iteration verdicts, and the synthesis report.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Recovery note: the `Review verdict` line stays CONDITIONAL while `NE3-P1-001` is active.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\n===\n- Required evidence: the findings registry totals, the three iteration verdicts, and the synthesis report.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/noedit-confirm-3b && tail -3 iterations/iteration-002.md; echo ===; tail -3 iterations/iteration-003.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794597813229,"end":1794597814031}}}}
